<item>
      <title><![CDATA[¿Por qué todos en España se cagan en algo?]]></title>
      <description><![CDATA[This guest post is for you if you’re interested in expressions used in Spain that are not typically taught in a classroom.]]></description>
      <link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/por-que-todos-en-espana-se-cagan</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">post:198464339</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 15:58:27 GMT</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603349798520-c949d4735084?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyNXx8Y2hlZWt5JTIwYXBlfGVufDB8fHx8MTc3OTEzMTI3NHww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
